# Environment variables for the local preview / Owner Studio server (server.js)
#
# No secrets are required for the static site itself — it is plain HTML/CSS/JS
# on GitHub Pages and the Supabase anon key is a public client-side value.
#
# Owner Studio editor (dashboard.html) writes straight to disk through the
# local Node server, so those write APIs require a passcode:
#
#   STUDIO_PASS   Passcode for the /dashboard.html editor.
#                 If unset, the server generates a random one and prints it
#                 on startup. Never commit a real value.
#   PORT          Optional. Static server port (default 3000).
#
# Example:
#   STUDIO_PASS=choose-a-strong-passcode npm run dev
